## 🔄 Complete Order Flow (Socket Events)

Here's the ENTIRE order lifecycle and which socket events fire at each step:

```
Customer places order (REST API)
        │
        ▼
  ┌─────────────────┐
  │ PENDING          │  No socket events yet (order is a draft)
  └────────┬────────┘
           │ Customer pays (REST API: POST /orders/confirm-draft)
           ▼
  ┌─────────────────┐
  │ CONFIRMED        │  Socket: 'new_payment' → Admin dashboard (same city)
  │                  │  Socket: 'order_ready' → Restaurant/Shop dashboard
  └────────┬────────┘
           │ Admin verifies payment (for EVC_PLUS)
           ▼
  ┌─────────────────┐
  │ CONFIRMED        │  Socket: 'payment_verified' → Admin dashboard
  │ (payment ok)     │  Socket: 'order_ready' → Restaurant/Shop dashboard
  └────────┬────────┘
           │ Restaurant clicks "Start Preparing"
           ▼
  ┌─────────────────┐
  │ PREPARING        │  Socket: 'order_status_updated' → Customer app
  │                  │  Socket: 'new_order_nearby' → Top 4 nearest riders
  │                  │  (retries every 2 min × 5 = 10 min total)
  └────────┬────────┘
           │ Rider accepts order (REST API)
           ▼
  ┌─────────────────┐
  │ ACCEPTED_BY_RIDER│  Socket: 'order_accepted' → Accepting rider
  │                  │  Socket: 'order_no_longer_available' → Other notified riders
  │                  │  Socket: 'rider_accepted' → Restaurant/Shop
  │                  │  Socket: 'order_status_updated' → Customer
  │                  │  Socket: 'rider_assigned' → Customer
  └────────┬────────┘
           │ Restaurant marks food ready
           ▼
  ┌─────────────────┐
  │ READY_FOR_PICKUP │  Socket: 'order_status_updated' → Customer, Rider
  └────────┬────────┘
           │ Rider picks up order
           ▼
  ┌─────────────────┐
  │ PICKED_UP        │  Socket: 'order_status_updated' → Customer, Restaurant
  │                  │  Socket: 'rider_location_update' → Customer (real-time GPS)
  └────────┬────────┘
           │ Rider delivers order
           ▼
  ┌─────────────────┐
  │ DELIVERED        │  Socket: 'order_status_updated' → Customer, Restaurant
  └─────────────────┘
```

### Escalation (if no rider accepts):
```
After 10 minutes (5 retries × 2 min) with no rider accepting:
  Socket: 'order_needs_attention' → Admin dashboard (same city)
  Socket: 'order_escalation' → Admin dashboard (with full details + nearby rider phones)
```

