## 📋 ALL Socket Events Reference

### Namespace: `/orders`

#### Events YOU EMIT (client → server)

| Event | Payload | Who Sends | Response |
|---|---|---|---|
| `ping` | `{}` | Anyone | `{ success: true }` + receives `pong` event |
| `register_admin` | `{ userId: "admin-user-id" }` | Admin dashboard | `{ success: true, adminId: "..." }` |
| `register_customer` | `{ customerId: "customer-user-id" }` | Customer app | `{ success: true, customerId: "..." }` |
| `register_rider` | `{ riderId: "rider-user-id" }` | Rider app | `{ success: true, riderId: "..." }` |
| `register_vendor` | `{ vendorType: "restaurant" \| "shop", vendorId: "vendor-id" }` | Restaurant/Shop dashboard | `{ success: true, room: "vendor:restaurant:abc123" }` |
| `subscribe_to_order` | `{ orderId: "order-id", customerId: "customer-id" }` | Customer app | `{ success: true, orderId: "..." }` |
| `unsubscribe_from_order` | `{ orderId: "order-id" }` | Customer app | `{ success: true }` |

#### Events YOU LISTEN TO (server → client)

| Event | Payload | Who Receives | When |
|---|---|---|---|
| `pong` | none | Anyone | Response to `ping` |
| `new_payment` | Full order object | Admin (same city) | Customer submits payment |
| `payment_verified` | `{ orderId, adminId }` | Admin (same city) | Admin verifies payment |
| `payment_rejected` | `{ orderId, adminId, reason }` | Admin (same city) | Admin rejects payment |
| `order_ready` | Full order object | Restaurant/Shop | Payment verified → order sent to vendor |
| `order_status_updated` | `{ orderId, status, timestamp, ...orderData }` | Customer | Any order status change |
| `rider_assigned` | `{ orderId, riderId }` | Customer | Rider accepts their order |
| `rider_location_update` | `{ orderId, location: { latitude, longitude, timestamp } }` | Customer, Restaurant/Shop | Rider GPS updates (continuous) |
| `new_order_nearby` | `{ orderId, publicId, vendorName, distance, estimatedEarnings, pickupAddress, deliveryAddress, items, paymentMethod, ... }` | Rider | New order available for pickup |
| `order_no_longer_available` | `{ orderId, reason, message }` | Rider | Another rider accepted the order |
| `order_accepted` | `{ orderId, order, timestamp }` | Rider | Your acceptance was confirmed |
| `order_status_update` | `{ orderId, status, timestamp }` | Rider | Order status changed for your active order |
| `rider_accepted` | `{ publicId, riderInfo: { name }, ... }` | Restaurant/Shop | A rider accepted their order |
| `order_needs_attention` | `{ orderId, reason, timestamp }` | Admin (same city) | No riders available |
| `order_escalation` | `{ orderId, publicId, orderTotal, restaurantName, customerName, nearbyRiderPhones, reason, priority: "HIGH", ... }` | Admin (same city) | 10-min escalation with full details |
| `new_deposit_request` | Deposit data | Admin (same city) | Rider requests wallet deposit |
| `new_withdrawal_request` | Withdrawal data | Admin (same city) | Rider requests wallet withdrawal |

---

### Namespace: `/rider-location`

#### Events YOU EMIT (client → server)

| Event | Payload | Who Sends | Response |
|---|---|---|---|
| `register_rider` | `{ riderId: "rider-user-id" }` | Rider app | `{ success: true, riderId: "...", status: "online" }` |
| `update_location` | `{ riderId, latitude, longitude, heading?, speed?, accuracy? }` | Rider app | `{ success: true, timestamp: 123456 }` |
| `update_status` | `{ riderId, status: "online" \| "offline" \| "busy" }` | Rider app | `{ success: true }` |
| `admin_subscribe_rider` | `{ riderId: "rider-user-id" }` | Admin dashboard | `{ success: true }` |
| `find_nearby_riders` | `{ latitude, longitude, radiusKm?, limit? }` | Admin dashboard | `{ success: true, riders: [...], count: N }` |
| `get_rider_location` | `{ riderId: "rider-user-id" }` | Admin dashboard | `{ success: true, location: { ... } }` |

#### Events YOU LISTEN TO (server → client)

| Event | Payload | Who Receives | When |
|---|---|---|---|
| `rider_status_updated` | `{ riderId, status }` | Everyone on namespace | Rider goes online/offline/busy |
| `rider_location_updated` | `{ riderId, latitude, longitude, timestamp, status, heading, speed, accuracy }` | Everyone on namespace | Any rider's location updates (for admin live map) |
| `rider_location_update` | Full location object | Admin subscribers of specific rider | Detailed update for subscribed rider |
| `new_order_nearby` | `{ orderId, distance, orderDetails }` | Rider | New order nearby (also emitted on `/orders` namespace) |

