## 📱 For Mobile App Developers

### Connection Setup (React Native / Flutter)

**React Native (socket.io-client):**
```javascript
import { io } from 'socket.io-client';

// Connection 1: Orders namespace (for order notifications)
const ordersSocket = io('https://your-api.com/orders', {
  transports: ['websocket', 'polling'],
  auth: { token: 'YOUR_JWT_TOKEN' },  // Optional, not enforced currently
});

// Connection 2: Rider location namespace (for GPS tracking)
const locationSocket = io('https://your-api.com/rider-location', {
  transports: ['websocket', 'polling'],
  auth: { token: 'YOUR_JWT_TOKEN' },
});
```

### Rider App - Minimum Integration

```javascript
// Step 1: Connect to BOTH namespaces
const ordersSocket = io('https://api.droviapp.com/orders', { transports: ['websocket'] });
const locationSocket = io('https://api.droviapp.com/rider-location', { transports: ['websocket'] });

// Step 2: Register on BOTH
ordersSocket.emit('register_rider', { riderId: USER_ID }, (res) => console.log(res));
locationSocket.emit('register_rider', { riderId: USER_ID }, (res) => console.log(res));

// Step 3: Go online
locationSocket.emit('update_status', { riderId: USER_ID, status: 'online' });

// Step 4: Start sending GPS
navigator.geolocation.watchPosition((pos) => {
  locationSocket.emit('update_location', {
    riderId: USER_ID,
    latitude: pos.coords.latitude,
    longitude: pos.coords.longitude,
    speed: pos.coords.speed,
    heading: pos.coords.heading,
    accuracy: pos.coords.accuracy,
  });
});

// Step 5: Listen for new orders (on ORDERS socket)
ordersSocket.on('new_order_nearby', (data) => {
  // Show order notification to rider
  // data = { orderId, publicId, vendorName, distance, estimatedEarnings, items, ... }
  showOrderNotification(data);
});

// Step 6: Listen for order no longer available
ordersSocket.on('order_no_longer_available', (data) => {
  // Remove order from UI - someone else took it
  removeOrderFromUI(data.orderId);
});

// Step 7: Accept order (via REST API, NOT socket)
// POST /api/v1/orders/:orderId/rider-accept

// Step 8: Listen for acceptance confirmation
ordersSocket.on('order_accepted', (data) => {
  // Navigate to active order screen
  navigateToActiveOrder(data.order);
});

// Step 9: Listen for status updates on your active order
ordersSocket.on('order_status_update', (data) => {
  // Update UI: data = { orderId, status, timestamp }
  updateOrderStatus(data);
});
```

### Customer App - Minimum Integration

```javascript
// Step 1: Connect to orders namespace
const socket = io('https://api.droviapp.com/orders', { transports: ['websocket'] });

// Step 2: Register as customer
socket.emit('register_customer', { customerId: USER_ID });

// Step 3: Subscribe to your specific order
socket.emit('subscribe_to_order', { orderId: ORDER_ID, customerId: USER_ID });

// Step 4: Listen for status updates
socket.on('order_status_updated', (data) => {
  // data = { orderId, status, timestamp, ...fullOrderData }
  updateOrderStatus(data.status);
});

// Step 5: Listen for rider assignment
socket.on('rider_assigned', (data) => {
  // data = { orderId, riderId }
  showRiderAssigned();
});

// Step 6: Listen for rider live location
socket.on('rider_location_update', (data) => {
  // data = { orderId, location: { latitude, longitude, timestamp } }
  updateRiderMarkerOnMap(data.location.latitude, data.location.longitude);
});

// Step 7: Cleanup when leaving
socket.emit('unsubscribe_from_order', { orderId: ORDER_ID });
socket.disconnect();
```

